  "intro": "1. Look for Tax-Free sign; show passport at counter (not vending machines). 2. Categories: consumables (food/cosmetics) vs general (electronics, clothing) — separate bags, sealed until departure. 3. Customs: You are a US visitor — Japan export OK; US import duty-free exemption ~$800 aggregate merchandise; declare over limit. 4. Receipt: Keep until KIX; staff may staple passport copy — remove carefully at immigration.",
